  "0": {
    "\\bHello! Sorry to keep you waiting!": "\\b你好！抱歉讓你久等了！",
    "\\bWelcome to the world of Pokémon.": "\\b歡迎來到寶可夢的世界。",
    "\\bMy name is Professor Oak.": "\\b我是大木博士。",
    "\\bPeople call me the Pokémon Professor.": "\\b大家都叫我寶可夢博士。",
    "\\bIf you need help, I am certainly capable of giving it.": "\\b如果需要幫忙，我很樂意協助你。",
    "\\bWell then, without further ado...": "\\b那麼，廢話不多說……",
    "<ac>\\c[0]\\l[3]You are about to enter a world\\nwhere you will embark on a grand\\nadventure of your very own.": "<ac>\\c[0]\\l[3]你即將踏入這個世界，\\n展開一場專屬於你的\\n精彩冒險。",
    "<ac>\\c[0]\\l[5]Speak to people and check things\\n wherever you go, be it in towns,\\nroads or caves.\\n Gather information and hints from\\n every possible source.": "<ac>\\c[0]\\l[5]無論身在城鎮、道路或洞窟，\\n都要多與人交談，\\n仔細調查周圍的事物。\\n盡可能從各個地方\\n蒐集資訊與提示。",
    "<ac>\\c[0]\\l[3]New paths will open to you when\\n you help people in need, overcome\\n challenges, and solve mysteries.": "<ac>\\c[0]\\l[3]幫助有需要的人、\\n克服挑戰並解開謎團，\\n就能開拓新的道路。",
    "<ac>\\c[0]\\l[7]At times, you will be challenged\\n by others to a battle.\\n At other times, wild creatures\\nmay stand in your way.\\n\\n By overcoming such hurdles,\\nyou will gain great power.": "<ac>\\c[0]\\l[7]有時，你會遇到其他人\\n向你提出對戰挑戰。\\n有時，野生的寶可夢\\n也會擋住你的去路。\\n\\n克服這些難關，\\n你就能變得更加強大。",
    "<ac>\\c[0]\\l[2]However, your adventure is not\\n solely about becoming powerful.": "<ac>\\c[0]\\l[2]但是，這趟冒險的意義\\n並不只是變得強大。",
    "<ac>\\c[0]\\l[7]On your travels, we hope that\\n you will meet countless people\\n and, through them, achieve\\npersonal growth.\\n\\n This is the most important\\nobjective of this adventure.": "<ac>\\c[0]\\l[7]希望你在旅途中，\\n能與各式各樣的人相遇，\\n並且透過這些相遇，\\n獲得成長。\\n\\n這才是這趟冒險\\n最重要的目標。",
    "\\bThis world is inhabited by creatures we call Pokémon.": "\\b這個世界生活著一種叫做寶可夢的生物。",
    "\\bPeople and Pokémon live together by supporting each other.": "\\b人類和寶可夢互相扶持，一起生活。",
    "\\bSome people play with Pokémon, some battle with them.": "\\b有些人和寶可夢一起玩耍，有些人則和牠們並肩對戰。",
    "\\bBut we don't know everything about Pokémon yet.": "\\b不過，我們對寶可夢還不是完全了解。",
    "\\bThere are still many mysteries to solve.": "\\b還有許多謎團等待著我們去解開。",
    "\\bThat's why I study Pokémon every day.": "\\b所以我每天都在研究寶可夢。",
    "\\bAre you a boy or a girl?": "\\b你是男孩，還是女孩呢？",
    "\\bNow what did you say your name was?": "\\b對了，你叫什麼名字呢？",
    "\\bSo you're \\PN?": "\\b原來你叫\\PN啊？",
    "\\bWhat is your name?": "\\b你的名字是？",
    "\\b\\PN, are you ready?": "\\b\\PN，你準備好了嗎？",
    "\\bYour very own Pokémon story is about to unfold.": "\\b專屬於你的寶可夢故事即將展開。",
    "\\bYou'll face fun times and tough challenges.": "\\b旅途中既有歡樂的時光，也有艱難的挑戰。",
    "\\bA world of dreams and adventures with Pokémon awaits!  Let's go!": "\\b充滿夢想與冒險的寶可夢世界正等著你！出發吧！",
    "You can find a lot of useful information about the game in the Helpful Notes folder.": "在Helpful Notes資料夾中，可以找到許多實用的遊戲資訊。",
    "Hello, \\PN!\\nI can see you calling me over there!": "你好，\\PN！\\n我看到你在那邊叫我了！",
    "Come over and talk to me.": "過來和我說話吧。",
    "Hello, this is Professor Oak...\\nOh, hello, \\PN!": "你好，我是大木博士……\\n喔，是你啊，\\PN！",
    "So, how's your Pokédex coming along?": "你的寶可夢圖鑑收集得如何了？",
    "Hmm, let's see..\\nYou've seen \\v[1] Pokémon, and \\nyou've caught \\v[2] Pokémon!\\nI see!": "嗯，我看看……\\n你遇見了\\v[1]種寶可夢，\\n也捕捉了\\v[2]種！\\n原來如此！",
    "Hmm, you still have a long journey ahead of you! \\nKeep on going!": "嗯，你的旅程還很漫長呢！\\n繼續加油吧！",
    "Hmm, you're catching Pokémon at a decent pace!": "嗯，你收集寶可夢的進度相當不錯呢！",
    "You've caught a lot of Pokémon, but make sure you're raising them carefully!": "你捕捉了很多寶可夢，但也別忘了用心培育牠們！",
    "I didn't even know that many Pokémon existed!": "連我都不知道原來有這麼多種寶可夢！",
    "Show me your Pokédex again anytime!": "隨時都可以再拿圖鑑給我看！",
    "Show me your Pokédex anytime!": "隨時都可以拿圖鑑給我看！",
    "Click!\\wt[10]\\n......\\wt[5] ......": "喀嚓！\\wt[10]\\n……\\wt[5]……",
    "\\bDo you want me to stop following you?": "\\b你希望我不要再跟著你了嗎？",
    "\\bI'll stay here, then.": "\\b那我就留在這裡吧。",
    "\\bLet's keep going!": "\\b我們繼續前進吧！"
  },
